WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Stop explaining. Show your AI. AI PagePolish helps communicate visual website changes.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
A real page opens in the app. The user selects a headline, increases its font size, and previews the change.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
An arrow points from a button toward the paragraph above. Its saved note says: Move the button closer to the text.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
The app creates a handoff ZIP. An editorial animation shows the visual brief being dragged into an AI chat.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.000
AI PagePolish by PageTweaker. Show exactly what you mean. Download for macOS.
